1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:04,149
This is Symbolon, fixed-rate financing on Canton DevNet.

2
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:10,843
This walkthrough uses simulated assets and authorized demo parties.

3
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:16,203
The faucet supplies demo collateral and demo cash.

4
00:00:18,850 --> 00:00:22,864
The borrower requests one thousand dollars for thirty days.

5
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:29,861
Publishing shares the request terms with connected Symbolon users.

6
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:36,187
Publishing does not move assets or select a rate.

7
00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:50,235
The lender reads the request and chooses seven percent.

8
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:57,151
Sending this funded quote reserves the lender's cash.

9
00:00:59,850 --> 00:01:03,446
Other lenders cannot see this private quote or APR.

10
00:01:07,850 --> 00:01:11,721
The borrower reviews the fixed interest and total repayment.

11
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:20,506
Repayment is agreed before settlement, using annualized simple interest.

12
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:27,667
Settlement exchanges cash for locked collateral in one transaction.

13
00:01:31,650 --> 00:01:35,286
The accepted request closes, and the position becomes active.

14
00:01:37,650 --> 00:01:41,421
The repayment stays fixed, while collateral risk remains.

15
00:01:48,700 --> 00:01:52,343
Repayment returns the collateral and closes the agreement.

16
00:02:01,750 --> 00:02:05,667
The confirmed ledger receipt verifies this repurchased position.

17
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:17,719
Try the public DevNet app, and explore the documentation.
